binding site is alternately exposed to either one or the other side of the membrane (PubMed:17673510, PubMed:26801567, PubMed:32818062). Also acts as a DIDS- and thiosulfate- sensitive anion exchanger the exchange of chloride for bicarbonate ions across the cell membrane (PubMed:11834742, PubMed:15800055)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}